      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah exactly. it's just... i spent so much time in a world where things actually mattered, where everything was real and high stakes. now i'm back and it just feels like i'm a ghost haunting a place i don't belong to. i don't think i can ever really go back to being one of them. it's like i've outlived my purpose or something.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
